# ============================================================
#  Mineways Mobile —— 版本库忽略规则
#  开源版**不收录任何编译好的 APK / AAB**，也不收录签名密钥。
#  Open-source version ships **no prebuilt APK/AAB** and no signing keys.
# ============================================================

# ---- 编译产物：APK / AAB / 中间产物（开源版一律不入库）----
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
*.jar
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
build/
*/build/
**/build/
.gradle/
.cxx/
obj/
libs/
outputs/
release/
debug/
captures/
*.hprof

# ---- 签名与密钥：绝不入库（assembleRelease 请自备 keystore）----
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.der
keystore.properties
signing.properties
产物/

# ---- 本机/环境相关（路径、代理等）----
local.properties
android-env.sh
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp

# ---- 工具备份与临时文件 ----
tools/_backup/
*.orig
*.rej

# ---- IDE / 系统 ----
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.project
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- 导出、运行期产物 ----
导出报错/
预览缓存/
